---
// The gate — a checkpoint every push walks through.
---
<figure class="figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 280" role="img" aria-label="Documents pass through a checkpoint. Honest ones reach main; a mislabelled one bounces.">
    <g class="sv">
      <!-- incoming docs -->
      <g transform="translate(30 40)">
        <rect class="sv-mini" width="150" height="40" rx="8" />
        <text class="sv-mono" x="14" y="25">status: active ✓</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(30 110)">
        <rect class="sv-mini" width="150" height="40" rx="8" />
        <text class="sv-mono" x="14" y="25">stamped ✓</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(30 190)">
        <rect class="sv-mini sv-mini-bad" width="150" height="40" rx="8" />
        <text class="sv-mono sv-rust-t" x="14" y="25">badge ≠ shelf</text>
      </g>

      <!-- the gate -->
      <rect class="sv-gate" x="288" y="24" width="152" height="232" rx="14" />
      <text class="sv-mono sv-on-dark" x="364" y="58" text-anchor="middle">check-docs</text>
      <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" x="364" y="82" text-anchor="middle">9 assertions</text>
      <g class="sv-checks" transform="translate(310 104)">
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="16">✓ badge present</text>
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="40">✓ badge = shelf</text>
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="64">✓ links alive</text>
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="88">✓ map fresh</text>
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="112">✓ no duplicates</text>
        <text class="sv-chip sv-on-dark-dim" y="136">…</text>
      </g>

      <!-- outcomes -->
      <path class="sv-path-pine" d="M 184 60 L 282 74" marker-end="url(#gp)" />
      <path class="sv-path-pine" d="M 184 130 L 282 130" marker-end="url(#gp)" />
      <path class="sv-path-rust" d="M 184 210 C 236 210 258 230 280 242 C 244 260 212 248 190 240" marker-end="url(#gr)" />
      <text class="sv-chip sv-rust" x="196" y="266">exit 1 — fix it first</text>

      <path class="sv-path-pine" d="M 444 110 L 548 110" marker-end="url(#gp)" />
      <rect class="sv-index" x="556" y="86" width="140" height="48" rx="10" />
      <text class="sv-mono sv-strong" x="626" y="115" text-anchor="middle">main</text>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <marker id="gp" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--pine)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="gr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--rust)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Structure nobody checks is a suggestion. The gate blocks the push until the tree tells the
    truth again — and it only ever fires on a real defect.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
